    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements<br>Three Story Home<br>1st | Guest, Queen;<br>2nd | Master, King; Guest, Queen; Guest, Queen<br>3rd | Guest, Two Twin over Twin Bunks and One Full over Full Bunk<br><br>Parking: This property offers two parking spots, providing easy and reliable access for guests throughout their stay.<br><br>Coastal Luxury at The Preserve – 5 bedroom, 3-Story Beach Retreat Steps from 30A and Rosemary Beach<br>Welcome to your dream beach getaway in the heart of Inlet Beach! Located in the exclusive Preserve at Inlet Beach community, this beautifully appointed 3-story, 5-bedroom, 4-bathroom home is the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience—just a short walk or bike ride from 30Avenue, Rosemary Beach, and multiple public beach accesses.<br><br>Inside, the home is thoughtfully designed for both relaxation and entertaining. The primary suite offers a true escape, featuring a king-size bed, private balcony, an oversized spa-style bathroom, and a generous walk-in closet.<br><br>Three additional guest bedrooms each feature cozy queen beds, while the custom-designed third-floor bunk room is built for fun with two twin-over-twin bunks, one full-over-full bunk, and a pool table—perfect for movie nights or competitive family fun.<br><br>The open-concept main living area flows into a fully stocked kitchen and spacious dining space, ideal for gathering after a beach day. Step outside to your own private outdoor oasis featuring multiple BBQ grill options, including a propane grill and two Big Green Egg grills, and comfy seating, and an outdoor shower to rinse off the sand.<br><br>This home also comes equipped with everything you need for the beach, including beach chairs, umbrellas, and toys stored in the garage, plus private parking in the driveway for added ease.<br><br>You'll also enjoy access to the community pool and dock, making it easy to cool off or launch a paddleboard adventure. And with the Panama City Beach Airport (ECP) just 30 minutes away, getting here is as easy as kicking off your flip-flops.<br><br>Whether you're planning a family vacation, a couples’ retreat, or a fun-filled friends’ trip, this coastal gem offers the perfect setting to relax, recharge, and make unforgettable memories.<br><br>Guest Walk-Through<br>1st Floor: Living, Dining, Kitchen, 1 Guest Bedroom & 1 Full Bath<br>2nd Floor: Master Bedroom & Ensuite Bath, 2 Guest Bedrooms, 1 Guest Bath<br>3rd Floor: Bunk Bedroom & Full Bath<br><br>Unit Amenities- BBQ Grills, Laundry, Driveway Parking<br>Community Amenities- Pool, Dock<br><br>The Preserve at Inlet Beach – A Coastal Sanctuary Between Lake Powell and the Gulf<br>Nestled between the serene waters of Lake Powell and the Gulf of Mexico, The Preserve at Inlet Beach offers a harmonious blend of luxury living and natural beauty. This boutique community features meticulously designed homes that embody Southern Coastal Cottage, creating a timeless aesthetic. Enjoy access to a community pool with a pavilion, an outdoor fireplace, and a boardwalk leading to a dock on Lake Powell—perfect for kayaking, paddleboarding, or simply unwinding by the water.?<br><br>Beyond its tranquil setting, The Preserve is ideally located for those seeking both relaxation and adventure. Just a short walk from the community, 30Avenue offers a curated selection of boutiques, restaurants, and entertainment options. The Inlet Beach public access, the largest on 30A, is also within walking distance, providing easy access to the pristine sands of the Gulf. Additionally, the charming towns of Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach are nearby, offering upscale dining, shopping, and cultural experiences.?<br><br>With its prime location, elegant homes, and proximity to both natural wonders and vibrant communities, The Preserve at Inlet Beach stands as a premier destination for those seeking a refined coastal lifestyle.<br><br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet<br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
