            "response": "Thank you for your feedback—we’re glad you found the house well-equipped and enjoyed your stay overall. We apologize for the dust and trash issues you encountered. We want you to know that we now have scheduled trash service for this home to prevent this from happening in the future. We appreciate you bringing this to our attention and hope to provide an even better experience next time!",
